{"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SQ","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SH","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Creating-a-URL-from-a-template","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/init(template:variables:)"],"title":"Creating a URL from a template"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Creating a template","anchor":"Creating-a-template","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/init(_:)"]},{"title":"Supporting types","anchor":"Supporting-types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/Value","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/VariableName"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/Equatable-Implementations"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Template"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is an template that can be expanded into","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL","isActive":true},{"text":" by calling ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URL(template:variables:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Templating has a rich set of options for substituting various parts of URLs. See","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/datatracker.ietf.org\/doc\/html\/rfc6570","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"details."}]},{"level":3,"text":"Example 1","type":"heading","anchor":"Example-1"},{"code":["let template = URL.Template(\"http:\/\/www.example.com\/foo{?query,number}\")!","let url = URL(","    template: template,","    variables: [","        .query: \"bar baz\",","        .number: \"234\",","    ]",")","","extension URL.Template.VariableName {","    static var query: URL.Template.VariableName { .init(\"query\") }","    static var number: URL.Template.VariableName { .init(\"number\") }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The resulting URL will be","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"text","code":["http:\/\/www.example.com\/foo?query=bar%20baz&number=234"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Usage","anchor":"Usage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Templates provide a description of a URL space and define how URLs can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"be constructed given specific variable values. Their intended use is,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for example, to allow a server to communicate to a client how to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"construct URLs for particular resources.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For each specific resource, an API contract is required to clearly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"define the variables applicable to that resource and its associated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"template. For example, such an API contract might specify that the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"variable ","type":"text"},{"code":"query","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is mandatory and must be an alphanumeric string","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the variable "},{"code":"number","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is optional and must be a positive integer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if provided. The server could then provide the client with a template"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as "},{"code":"http:\/\/www.example.com\/foo{?query,number}","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which the client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can subsequently use to substitute variables accordingly."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An API contract is necessary to define which substitutions are valid","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"within a given URL space. There is no guarantee that every possible"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"expansion of variable expressions corresponds to an existing resource","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"URL; indeed, some expansions may not even produce a valid URL. Only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the API specification itself can determine which expansions are","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expected to yield valid URLs corresponding to existing resources."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Example-2","type":"heading","text":"Example 2"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here’s an example, that illustrates how to define a specific set of variables:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct MyQueryTemplate: Sendable, Hashable {","    var template: URL.Template","","    init?(_ template: String) {","        guard let t = URL.Template(template) else { return nil }","        self.template = t","    }","}","","struct MyQuery: Sendable, Hashable {","    var query: String","    var number: Int?","","    var variables: [URL.Template.VariableName: URL.Template.Value] {","        var result: [URL.Template.VariableName: URL.Template.Value] = [","            .query: .text(query)","        ]","        if let number {","            result[.number] = .text(\"\\(number)\")","        }","        return result","    }","}","","extension URL.Template.VariableName {","    static var query: URL.Template.VariableName { .init(\"query\") }","    static var number: URL.Template.VariableName { .init(\"number\") }","}","","extension URL {","    init?(","        template: MyQueryTemplate,","        query: MyQuery","    ) {","        self.init(","            template: template.template,","            variables: query.variables","        )","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","extendedModule":"FoundationEssentials","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV8TemplateV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Template"}],"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"26.0"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false}],"modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"role":"symbol","title":"URL.Template","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Template","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/url\/template"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A template for constructing a URL from variable expansions."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/URL":{"title":"URL","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/url","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"URL"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"URL"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A value that identifies the location of a resource, such as an item on a remote server or the path to a local file.","type":"text"}]},"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/URL/Template/Value":{"abstract":[{"text":"The value of a variable used for expanding a template.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"URL.Template.Value","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/Value","url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/url\/template\/value","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Value","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://FoundationEssentials/SQ":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SQ","title":"Swift.Equatable"},"doc://FoundationEsse